{"pages":[{"w":612,"ocr":false,"h":792,"segs":[["HOW TO SPEND A DAY WITH THE LORD 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,667.32330000000002,9,false],["SPENDING A DAY",150.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,448.34000000000003,116.00059999999996,80,false],["WITH THE LORD",150.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,429.05999999999995,176.00059999999996,80,false],["RYAN BERG",150.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,255.24000000000001,194.10059999999999,20,false],["• to worship God",369.20000000000005,224.88939999999991,445.26800000000003,237.29139999999995,9,false],["• to experience His presence",369.20000000000005,237.88939999999991,489.82700000000006,250.29139999999995,9,false],["• “to be progressing in an intimate knowledge and",369.20000000000005,250.88939999999991,569.26100000000008,263.29139999999995,9,false],["experience of God’s person,presence and power”",387.20000000000005,263.88939999999991,570.69200000000001,276.29139999999995,9,false],["(John 17:3, Philippians 3:8-10, Deuteronomy",387.20000000000005,276.88939999999991,557.08400000000006,289.29139999999995,9,false],["4:29)",387.20000000000005,289.88939999999997,407.09000000000003,302.29139999999995,9,false],["THE RIGHT PLACE AND TIME",369.20000000000005,322.27439999999996,492.96000000000009,342.81439999999998,20,false],["You need to be alone. Jesus often withdrew to be alone",369.20000000000005,341.88939999999997,574.58900000000006,354.29139999999995,9,false],["with God (Luke 6:12).",369.20000000000005,354.88939999999997,450.7940000000001,367.29139999999995,9,false],["THE NEED TO WITHDRAW",145.40000000000001,361.27439999999996,255.76000000000005,381.81439999999998,20,false],["In ministry, there is always something important",145.40000000000001,380.88939999999997,330.65600000000018,393.29139999999995,9,false],["to do. The demands of our role as messengers of the",145.40000000000001,393.88940000000002,339.57500000000016,406.29140000000001,9,false],["gospel seems to be never-ending. But Jesus provides",145.40000000000001,406.88940000000002,343.35500000000002,419.29140000000001,9,false],["us with an example of the right priorities when it",145.40000000000001,419.88940000000002,329.87300000000005,432.29140000000001,9,false],["comes to working for God and being with God: He",145.40000000000001,432.88940000000002,332.76200000000006,445.29140000000001,9,false],["said to them, “I must proclaim the good news about",145.40000000000001,445.88940000000002,338.60300000000007,458.29140000000001,9,false],["the kingdom of God to other towns also, because I was",145.40000000000001,458.88940000000002,348.971,471.29140000000001,9,false],["sent for this purpose.”...The news about Him spread",145.40000000000001,471.88940000000002,339.59300000000007,484.29140000000001,9,false],["even more, and large crowds would come together to",145.40000000000001,484.88940000000002,343.48100000000011,497.29140000000001,9,false],["hear Him and to be healed of their sicknesses. Yet He",145.40000000000001,497.88940000000002,345.05600000000004,510.29140000000001,9,false],["often withdrew to deserted places and prayed.",145.40000000000001,510.88940000000002,319.47800000000007,523.29140000000007,9,false],["Luke 4:43, 5:15-16",145.40000000000001,523.88940000000002,213.53900000000002,536.29140000000007,9,false],["You need to be undistracted by people, noise, and",369.20000000000005,380.88939999999997,554.19500000000016,393.29139999999995,9,false],["interruptions. If possible, you may want to be",369.20000000000005,393.88940000000002,539.93900000000019,406.29140000000001,9,false],["somewhere that you can pray out loud, sing, etc.",369.20000000000005,406.88940000000002,549.42500000000018,419.29140000000001,9,false],["without being selfconscious.",369.20000000000005,419.88940000000002,477.50600000000009,432.29140000000001,9,false],["SUGGESTIONS FOR WHAT TO DO",369.20000000000005,452.27440000000001,510.10000000000002,472.81440000000003,20,false],["PRAYER",369.20000000000005,482.36940000000004,395.54000000000008,497.77440000000001,15,false],["Ask God to remove any hindrance to your fellowship",369.20000000000005,497.88940000000002,567.02900000000011,510.29140000000001,9,false],["with Him. Focus on the reality of His presence by",369.20000000000005,510.88940000000002,555.22100000000012,523.29140000000007,9,false],["reading through a passage such as Psalm 139 and then",369.20000000000005,523.88940000000002,572.55500000000006,536.29140000000007,9,false],["focus on cleansing passages like Psalm 139:23,24;",369.20000000000005,536.88940000000002,555.6260000000002,549.29139999999995,9,false],["Psalm 51; or Psalm 32.",369.20000000000005,549.88940000000002,453.08900000000006,562.29139999999995,9,false],["THE RIGHT PERSPECTIVE",145.40000000000001,556.27440000000001,255.48000000000002,576.81439999999998,20,false],["IT IS NOT:",145.40000000000001,586.36940000000004,176.96000000000004,601.77440000000001,15,false],["• to please God",145.40000000000001,601.88940000000002,214.34899999999999,614.29139999999995,9,false],["• to have a better day",145.40000000000001,614.88940000000002,236.381,627.29139999999995,9,false],["• because you “ought to”",145.40000000000001,627.88940000000002,249.31400000000002,640.29139999999995,9,false],["• because God will discipline you if you don’t",145.40000000000001,640.88940000000002,326.56100000000015,653.29139999999995,9,false],["• to learn more about God",145.40000000000001,653.88940000000002,255.12800000000004,666.29139999999995,9,false],["• to have something to share",145.40000000000001,666.88940000000002,264.75800000000004,679.29139999999995,9,false],["• to grow",145.40000000000001,679.88940000000002,191.822,692.29139999999995,9,false],["IT IS:",145.40000000000001,703.36940000000004,161.82500000000002,718.77440000000001,15,false],["• to know God",145.40000000000001,718.88940000000002,211.25300000000001,731.29139999999995,9,false],["Praise and thanksgiving - Praise God through",369.20000000000005,575.88940000000002,540.72200000000009,588.29139999999995,9,false],["Scripture passages like Psalm 103, 111, or 145 or",369.20000000000005,588.88940000000002,549.52400000000011,601.29139999999995,9,false],["Revelation 4 and 5. Or give praise and thanksgiving for",369.20000000000005,601.88940000000002,574.92200000000025,614.29139999999995,9,false],["specific things in your life.",369.20000000000005,614.88940000000002,468.81200000000007,627.29139999999995,9,false],["Ask God:",369.20000000000005,640.88940000000002,403.22900000000004,653.29139999999995,9,false],["• to speak and help you to hear",369.20000000000005,653.88940000000002,496.49600000000009,666.29139999999995,9,false],["• to reveal more of Himself to you",369.20000000000005,666.88940000000002,508.08800000000008,679.29139999999995,9,false],["• for the willingness to do what He shows you",369.20000000000005,679.88940000000002,552.98900000000003,692.29139999999995,9,false],["• for a disciplined, sharp mind",369.20000000000005,692.88940000000002,495.65900000000005,705.29139999999995,9,false],["• to minimize distractions",369.20000000000005,705.88940000000002,480.96200000000005,718.29139999999995,9,false],["• for a supernatural, excellent time of interaction",369.20000000000005,718.88940000000002,566.74100000000021,731.29139999999995,9,false]]},{"w":612,"segs":[["with Him",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,200.82300000000001,45.836899999999901,9,false],["INSPIRATIONAL MEDITATION AND READING",146.40000000000001,69.914899999999989,288.34500000000003,85.319899999999961,15,false],["Read an article or a chapter from an encouraging,",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,332.68200000000013,97.836899999999901,9,false],["faith-stimulating book (suggested reading on",146.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,316.90500000000009,110.8368999999999,9,false],["CruPressGreen: “Hearing the Music of the Gospel”,",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,340.21500000000003,123.8368999999999,9,false],["“Mission Impossible” or Tim Keller’s “Prayer and the",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,347.59500000000014,136.8368999999999,9,false],["Gospel”)",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,179.745,149.8368999999999,9,false],["If you keep a journal, read back over past weeks or",146.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,335.01300000000003,175.8368999999999,9,false],["months",146.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,175.67700000000002,188.8368999999999,9,false],["TIME IN THE WORD",146.40000000000001,212.91489999999999,209.29500000000002,228.31989999999996,15,false],["Be relaxed, flexible, and not overly structured",146.40000000000001,228.43489999999986,317.69700000000006,240.8368999999999,9,false],["(maybe read some Psalms, then some Old Testament",146.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,345.59700000000009,253.8368999999999,9,false],["passages, then some from the life of Christ, then some",146.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,349.74600000000009,266.8368999999999,9,false],["from the Epistles, etc.)",146.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,232.26900000000001,279.8368999999999,9,false],["Read and meditate with an attitude of prayer",146.40000000000001,293.43489999999997,315.66300000000012,305.83689999999996,9,false],["• pray meaningful passages back to God",159.90000000000001,306.43489999999997,322.04399999999998,318.83689999999996,9,false],["• pray about needs the passages make you",159.90000000000001,319.43489999999997,329.53200000000004,331.83689999999996,9,false],["aware of",177.90000000000001,332.43489999999997,210.21899999999999,344.83689999999996,9,false],["Write down things that impress you as you read and",146.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,341.99700000000007,370.83689999999996,9,false],["meditate",146.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,180.62700000000001,383.83689999999996,9,false],["HOW TO SPEND A DAY WITH THE LORD 2",43.841199999999994,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,668.11529999999993,9,false],["PRAYER",146.40000000000001,407.91489999999999,172.74000000000001,423.31989999999996,15,false],["• Thank God for time in His Word and what He’s",146.40000000000001,423.43489999999997,341.62800000000004,435.83689999999996,9,false],["shown you",164.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,205.197,448.83689999999996,9,false],["• Pray through some Scripture, songs or hymns",146.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,336.83100000000002,461.83689999999996,9,false],["• Catch up on requests you haven’t had time to",146.40000000000001,462.43489999999997,333.62700000000007,474.83689999999996,9,false],["pray for lately. Pray some of Paul’s prayers for",164.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,336.05700000000013,487.83689999999996,9,false],["other people (e.g. Philippians 1, Colossians 1 or 3,",164.40000000000001,488.43490000000003,349.49400000000014,500.83690000000001,9,false],["Ephesians 1 or 3, and others)",164.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,273.22800000000001,513.83690000000001,9,false],["• Ask God",146.40000000000001,514.43489999999997,196.46700000000001,526.83690000000001,9,false],["• to show you what He wants you to believe",159.90000000000001,527.43489999999997,334.87800000000004,539.83690000000001,9,false],["Him for",177.90000000000001,540.43489999999997,207.90600000000001,552.83690000000001,9,false],["• to show you some specific dreams or goals in",159.90000000000001,553.43489999999997,346.36200000000008,565.83690000000001,9,false],["the various areas of your life and ministry",177.90000000000001,566.43489999999997,335.59800000000013,578.83690000000001,9,false],["• for His wisdom",159.90000000000001,579.43489999999997,236.166,591.83690000000001,9,false],["JOURNAL",146.40000000000001,615.91489999999999,178.31999999999999,631.31989999999996,15,false],["• Record what God shows you in light of dreams",146.40000000000001,631.43489999999997,339.32400000000007,643.83690000000001,9,false],["or goals in your personal life, ministry and other",164.40000000000001,644.43489999999997,346.1640000000001,656.83690000000001,9,false],["relationships.",164.40000000000001,657.43489999999997,216.86099999999999,669.83690000000001,9,false]],"ocr":false,"h":792}]}